            <div class="toolkit-grid">

                <div class="card" data-reveal>
                    <h3>Node &amp; Express</h3>
                    <p>
                        Separating an API into routes, controllers and models so the data layer can
                        change without rewriting the HTTP layer. Middleware, error handling, config
                        kept out of the source.
                    </p>
                    <dl>
                        <div class="skill-row">
                            <dt>Express routing</dt>
                            <dd class="is-core">
                                <span>Foundational+</span>
                                <span class="meter" role="img" aria-label="Foundational plus, three of five">
                                    <span class="meter-fill" style="--n: 3"></span>
                                </span>
                            </dd>
                        </div>
                        <div class="skill-row">
                            <dt>Layered architecture</dt>
                            <dd>
                                <span>Foundational+</span>
                                <span class="meter" role="img" aria-label="Foundational plus, three of five">
                                    <span class="meter-fill" style="--n: 3"></span>
                                </span>
                            </dd>
