                        concatenated.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="card" data-reveal>
                    <h3>REST API design</h3>
                    <p>
                        Resources as endpoints, the right status codes instead of one generic
                        failure, and validating input before it reaches the data layer.
                    </p>
                    <dl>
                        <div class="skill-row">
                            <dt>Resource routing</dt>
                            <dd class="is-core">
